This directory contains the StarlingX helm chart for the Containerized Data
Importer (CDI). The Helm Chart is derived from Kubernetes yaml files for CDI.
The original sources were retrieved from:

https://github.com/kubevirt/containerized-data-importer/releases/download/${VERSION}/cdi-cr.yaml
https://github.com/kubevirt/containerized-data-importer/releases/download/${VERSION}/cdi-operator.yaml.

Additional information can be found at https://kubevirt.io/.

As the CDI versions are updated, maintainers of this repo will need to update
the helm chart.
